    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθρῡλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spread abroad,</i> mostly in pf. and
				plpf.
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be commonly reported,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διετεθρύλητο ὡς . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.1.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be hackneyed,</i> of a quotation, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cim.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be talked deaf,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθρυλουμένους ὑπό σου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.2.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατεθρύλημαι ἀκούων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					205b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατεθρυλημένος τὰ ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					358c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
